{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2203","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2203","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2203\",\"parent_revision\":\"c7dcd28f5b068e2299ba566d90fa346bcb9e9c927be885d6f2c02b6bb2e63f56\",\"root_revision\":\"c7dcd28f5b068e2299ba566d90fa346bcb9e9c927be885d6f2c02b6bb2e63f56\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe `validate-summarizer-output` SubagentStop hook in `plugins/summarizer/hooks/hooks.json` has no matcher, so it fires on every subagent completion regardless of agent type. The hook correctly self-filters at Step 1 (agent type check), but the LLM invocation still runs, consuming tokens and generating repeated \\\"condition not satisfied\\\" feedback messages in sessions that use non-summarizer agents.\\n\\nFix: add a `matcher` field to the SubagentStop hook entry scoped to summarizer agent types:\\n\\n```json\\n\\\"matcher\\\": \\\"file-summarizer|url-summarizer|image-summarizer\\\"\\n```\\n\\nThis eliminates unnecessary hook invocations for non-summarizer agents while preserving full validation for the three summarizer types the hook is designed to gate.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **add subagentstop matcher to summarizer hook to suppress noise for non-summarizer agents** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Observed during session: hook fired 9+ times on dh:backlog-item-groomer agent completions, each time outputting {} at Step 1\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-05-08\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"4826041338e3e6e61f858daf017393badbffed72b17f9f8e8c97a20fb585c89f\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCaehA\"}"}